  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The tiger I saved as a child suddenly appeared as two companions?! And they say we three must sleep together for their souls to become one again?\n\n*\"Our wife is truly clumsy, trapping her husband between her legs like this-\"\n\n\"You wanted to touch it, didn't you...? A man's body.\"*\n\nLiving as newlyweds with two divine beings who pounce on me at all hours - can my heart really endure this?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
